<ul class="pts"><li>The approved expected answers</li><li>Key assessment criteria</li><li>Acceptable alternatives</li><li>Any critical safety issues</li></ul>
<p>You will also receive the approved marking sheet for each station. The clinical and viva sheets are shown in Module 6.</p></div></div>

